# STIG RHEL-09-231190: rpm cryptsetup
# STIG ID: V-257879 (HIGH)

META
    esp_id `r9-rhel-09-231190-luks-cryptsetup-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `critical`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-231190: RHEL 9 local disk partitions must implement cryptographic mechanisms to prevent `
    description `RHEL 9 local disk partitions must implement cryptographic mechanisms to prevent unauthorized disclosure or modification of all information that requires at rest protection.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig,package,rpm`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-231190,NIST-800-53:SC-28,NIST-800-53:SC-28(1)`
    control_objective `SC-28`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Rocky9:localhost:os-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `1`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for RHEL-09-231190.`

    component_id `comp-r9-os`

    impl_SC_28 `This control is validated by checking the required system configuration against the DISA STIG baseline for RHEL 9.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT pkg_check
        package_name `cryptsetup`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE pkg_state
        installed boolean = true
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN rpm_package
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF pkg_state
            OBJECT_REF pkg_check
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
